                <head>[Enclosures]</head>
                <p>1. Mr. Adams to Lord Russell, about the Phantom, &amp;c., March 26, 1863.</p>
                <p>2. Mr. Dudley to Mr. Adams, about same, March 24, 1863.</p>
                <p>3. Lord Russell to Mr. Adams, March 27, 1863.</p>
                <p>4.. Lord Russell to Mr. Adams, referring to Liverpool, March 28, 1863.</p>
                <p>5. Mr. Adams to Lord Russell, with case of the Alexandra and notes to C. R.
                    Yonge, March 30, 1863.</p>
                <p>6. Mr. Adams to Mr. Dudley, March 29, 1863.</p>
                <p>7. Lord Russell to Mr. Adams, March 31, 1863.</p>








